  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "We substitute the given sequence in each option and solve using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8a6f93b0f8305d496162d41f65450f13e20c650df2dbe481929271174df469e9.png] \n\nOption 1) 45 + __**15 ÷ 5**__ - 5 × 5 = 18 \n\n 45 + 3 - __**5 **____**×**____** 5**__ = 18\n\n __**45 + 3**__ - 25 = 18\n\n __**48 - 25**__ = 18\n\n 23 ≠ 18\n\nOption 2) 60 + __**15 ÷ 5**__ - 7 × 5 = 25\n\n 60 + 3 - __**7 × 5**__ = 25\n\n __**60 + 3**__ - 35 = 25\n\n __**63 - 35**__ = 25\n\n 28 ≠ 25\n\nOption 3) 45 + __**24 ÷ 8**__ - 7 × 5 = 23\n\n 45 + 3 - __**7 **____**×**____** 5**__ = 23\n\n __45 + 3__ - 35 = 23\n\n __48 - 35__ = 23\n\n 13 ≠ 23\n\nOption 4) 45 + __**15 ÷ 5**__ - 7 × 5 = 13\n\n 45 + 3 - **__7__**__ ____×____ 5__ = 13\n\n __45 + 3__ - 35 = 13\n\n __48 - 35__ = 13\n\n 13 = 13\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4)**",
